	<title>Gen Z Is Turning Against AI in an Incredible Way</title>
	<meta name="description" content="The AI backlash is particularly apparent among Gen Z, a demographic that&#039;s at the epicenter of the industry&#039;s push for AI adoption." />
	<link rel="canonical" href="https://futurism.com/artificial-intelligence/gen-z-turning-against-ai" />
